 .../media/platform/qcom/camss/camss-vfe-4-7.c |  3 ++-
 .../media/platform/qcom/camss/camss-vfe-4-8.c |  3 ++-
 .../platform/qcom/camss/camss-vfe-gen1.c      |  5 ++--
